+# COALEXT execution criterion
+
+Reuse the SHA-256-identified C3 producer to emit a deadline-clean admitted
+prefix beyond global-021, retain a sidecar for every shard, pass the unchanged
+production reader, reproduce EXACTTRAIN's surrogate-label gate, and report the
+new intersection with the 93 admitted exact-source anchors. No EE is computed.

